{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-graph-management","title":"依赖图管理：内部包依赖解析与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/dependency-graph-management","wordCount":1340,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖图管理-内部包依赖解析与治理\">依赖图管理：内部包依赖解析与治理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖图（DAG）</td>\n<td>描述 Monorepo 中包之间依赖关系的有向无环图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拓扑排序</td>\n<td>根据依赖图确定构建顺序，确保依赖包先于依赖方构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环依赖</td>\n<td>包 A 直接或间接依赖包 B，同时包 B 又依赖包 A，破坏 DAG 性质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript 项目引用</td>\n<td>通过 <code>composite</code> + <code>references</code> 配置让 tsc 感知依赖关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受影响分析</td>\n<td>从变更包出发，通过反向遍历找出所有间接受影响的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>孤立包</td>\n<td>没有任何包依赖它、且本身也不是应用的历史遗留包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"依赖图的概念与重要性\">依赖图的概念与重要性</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中，各包之间的依赖关系构成一张<strong>有向无环图（DAG）</strong>，称为依赖图（Dependency Graph）。理解并正确管理这张图，是 Monorepo 工程化的核心能力之一。</p>\n<p>依赖图的拓扑结构直接决定了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>构建顺序</strong>：必须先构建依赖，再构建依赖方</li>\n<li><strong>受影响分析</strong>：某个包变更后，哪些包需要重新构建或测试</li>\n<li><strong>并行度</strong>：哪些包可以并行构建（无依赖关系的包）</li>\n<li><strong>缓存失效范围</strong>：依赖发生变化时，哪些上游缓存需要失效</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    tooling/tsconfig --&gt; packages/utils&#10;    tooling/tsconfig --&gt; packages/ui&#10;    tooling/tsconfig --&gt; packages/hooks&#10;    tooling/eslint-config --&gt; packages/utils&#10;    tooling/eslint-config --&gt; packages/ui&#10;    packages/utils --&gt; packages/ui&#10;    packages/utils --&gt; packages/hooks&#10;    packages/ui --&gt; apps/web&#10;    packages/hooks --&gt; apps/web&#10;    packages/ui --&gt; apps/mobile\">graph LR\n    tooling/tsconfig --&gt; packages/utils\n    tooling/tsconfig --&gt; packages/ui\n    tooling/tsconfig --&gt; packages/hooks\n    tooling/eslint-config --&gt; packages/utils\n    tooling/eslint-config --&gt; packages/ui\n    packages/utils --&gt; packages/ui\n    packages/utils --&gt; packages/hooks\n    packages/ui --&gt; apps/web\n    packages/hooks --&gt; apps/web\n    packages/ui --&gt; apps/mobile</pre><p>上图展示了一个典型 Monorepo 的依赖图。其中 <code>tooling/tsconfig</code> 是图的源节点（无入边），<code>apps/web</code> 和 <code>apps/mobile</code> 是叶节点（无出边），所有路径都是有向的，且不存在环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"依赖解析机制\">依赖解析机制</h2><h3 id=\"workspace-内的模块解析\">workspace 内的模块解析</h3><p>当包 <code>apps/web</code> 依赖 <code>@myorg/ui</code>，Node.js 的模块解析算法会按以下顺序查找：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>查找 <code>apps/web/node_modules/@myorg/ui</code></li>\n<li>向上逐级查找 <code>node_modules/@myorg/ui</code>，直到找到或到达文件系统根目录</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在使用 pnpm 的 Monorepo 中，<code>@myorg/ui</code> 以符号链接的形式存在于 <code>node_modules/@myorg/ui</code>，指向 <code>packages/ui</code> 源码目录。这意味着开发时修改 <code>packages/ui/src/button.tsx</code>，无需任何重新安装操作，<code>apps/web</code> 即时感知变更。</p>\n<h3 id=\"typescript-路径解析\">TypeScript 路径解析</h3><p>仅有包管理器层面的链接还不够——TypeScript 编译器也需要知道如何解析内部包。有两种主流方案：</p>\n<p><strong>方案一：<code>paths</code> 别名映射（适合开发时 ts-node 或 Vite 场景）</strong></p>\n<p>在根 <code>tsconfig.base.json</code> 中配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseUrl&quot;: &quot;.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: [&quot;packages/utils/src/index.ts&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: [&quot;packages/ui/src/index.ts&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@myorg/hooks&quot;: [&quot;packages/hooks/src/index.ts&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/utils/src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/ui/src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/hooks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/hooks/src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各包的 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 继承基础配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;extends&quot;: &quot;../../tsconfig.base.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;./dist&quot;,&#10;    &quot;rootDir&quot;: &quot;./src&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"extends\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../tsconfig.base.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rootDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方案二：<code>composite</code> + 项目引用（适合 tsc 构建场景）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;references&quot;: [{ &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../../packages/utils&quot; }, { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../../packages/ui&quot; }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"composite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../packages/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../packages/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TypeScript 项目引用让 <code>tsc --build</code> 感知依赖关系，只重新编译变化的包，类似 Turborepo 的任务缓存机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"循环依赖检测与处理\">循环依赖检测与处理</h2><p>循环依赖（Circular Dependency）是 Monorepo 依赖图中最严重的问题之一。循环依赖不仅会导致构建工具无法确定执行顺序，还可能引发运行时的&quot;cannot read property of undefined&quot;类错误（模块初始化顺序问题）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"循环依赖的产生场景\">循环依赖的产生场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包互相依赖</td>\n<td><code>packages/ui</code> 依赖 <code>packages/utils</code>，<code>packages/utils</code> 又依赖 <code>packages/ui</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐式循环</td>\n<td>A → B → C → A（三方循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发依赖循环</td>\n<td>仅 devDependencies 产生的循环（不影响构建但需注意）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型依赖循环</td>\n<td>仅 TypeScript 类型层面的循环（<code>import type</code> 引入）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"检测工具与配置\">检测工具与配置</h3><p><strong>使用 <code>madge</code> 检测循环</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;pnpm add -Dw madge&#10;&#10;# 检测单个包&#10;madge --circular packages/ui/src/index.ts&#10;&#10;# 检测整个 monorepo（TypeScript 项目需指定 tsconfig）&#10;madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx --ts-config tsconfig.base.json packages/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Dw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> madge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测单个包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">madge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --circular</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages/ui/src/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测整个 monorepo（TypeScript 项目需指定 tsconfig）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">madge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --circular</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --extensions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ts,tsx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ts-config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsconfig.base.json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages/</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将检测集成到 CI：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# package.json scripts&#10;{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;check:circular&quot;: &quot;madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/ &amp;&amp; echo &#39;No circular deps&#39;&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># package.json scripts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    \"check:circular\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/ &#x26;&#x26; echo 'No circular deps'\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"循环依赖的重构策略\">循环依赖的重构策略</h3><p>发现循环依赖后，通常有三种重构方案：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：提取公共依赖层</strong></p>\n<p>若 A 和 B 互相依赖，说明它们共享了某些类型或逻辑，应将共享部分提取到新包 C：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Before: A ↔ B (循环)&#10;After:  A → C ← B (无循环，C 是新提取的包)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Before: A ↔ B (循环)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>After:  A → C ← B (无循环，C 是新提取的包)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略二：依赖反转（接口注入）</strong></p>\n<p>将具体依赖替换为接口依赖，通过依赖注入在运行时绑定。适用于无法直接提取的场景。</p>\n<p><strong>策略三：延迟导入</strong></p>\n<p>对于运行时才用到的依赖，改用动态 <code>import()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 替代静态 import（会产生循环）&#10;// import { formatDate } from &#39;@myorg/utils&#39;&#10;&#10;// 改为动态导入（延迟到使用时加载）&#10;async function renderDate(date: Date) {&#10;  const { formatDate } = await import(&#39;@myorg/utils&#39;);&#10;  return formatDate(date);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 替代静态 import（会产生循环）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// import { formatDate } from '@myorg/utils'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 改为动态导入（延迟到使用时加载）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">formatDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(date);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"依赖图可视化工具\">依赖图可视化工具</h2><p>可视化是理解复杂依赖关系的重要手段，主流工具提供了不同粒度的可视化能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"nx-项目图\">Nx 项目图</h3><p>Nx 提供最完整的依赖图可视化，支持交互式过滤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在浏览器中打开交互式项目图&#10;nx graph&#10;&#10;# 仅查看受某包影响的子图&#10;nx graph --focus=@myorg/ui&#10;&#10;# 导出为 JSON 供脚本处理&#10;nx graph --file=output.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在浏览器中打开交互式项目图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅查看受某包影响的子图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --focus=@myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 导出为 JSON 供脚本处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --file=output.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"turborepo-依赖分析\">Turborepo 依赖分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看 turbo pipeline 中的任务依赖图&#10;turbo build --dry=json | jq &#39;.packages&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 turbo pipeline 中的任务依赖图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry=json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.packages'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义脚本分析\">自定义脚本分析</h3><p>对于不使用 Nx/Turborepo 的项目，可以通过读取各包 <code>package.json</code> 构建依赖图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// scripts/analyze-deps.mjs&#10;import { globby } from &#39;globby&#39;;&#10;import { readFile } from &#39;fs/promises&#39;;&#10;&#10;const packageFiles = await globby([&#39;packages/*/package.json&#39;, &#39;apps/*/package.json&#39;]);&#10;const packages = await Promise.all(&#10;  packageFiles.map(async (file) =&gt; {&#10;    const pkg = JSON.parse(await readFile(file, &#39;utf-8&#39;));&#10;    return { name: pkg.name, deps: Object.keys(pkg.dependencies ?? {}) };&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;const internalPackageNames = new Set(packages.map((p) =&gt; p.name));&#10;for (const pkg of packages) {&#10;  const internalDeps = pkg.deps.filter((d) =&gt; internalPackageNames.has(d));&#10;  console.log(`${pkg.name} → [${internalDeps.join(&#39;, &#39;)}]`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// scripts/analyze-deps.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { globby } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'globby'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { readFile } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fs/promises'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#